    },
    {
      "target": "Strings/Objects",
      "key": "PrehistoricScapula_Description",
      "english": "Commonly known as a \"shoulder blade\"... It's unclear what species it belonged to.",
      "translation": "מוכרת בשם \"עצם הכתף\"... לא ברור לאיזה מין היא השתייכה."
    },
    {
      "target": "Strings/Objects",
